    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Baby, Child, Teenage \\u0026 Adult Circumcision in Southampton\",\"title\":\"Circumcision in Southampton\",\"lede\":\"Beverley Clinic provides circumcision for babies, children, teenagers and adults from Southampton and the surrounding areas.\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Visit us\",\"href\":\"/contact/\"},{\"label\":\"Southampton\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our main circumcision clinic is Beverley Clinic in Edgware, North-West London, where we provide our regular circumcision service.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>For patients who specifically want their circumcision performed in the Southampton area, we can arrange the procedure at clinical premises in Eastleigh.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"className\":\"wp-block-heading display d-3\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading display d-3\">Southampton Circumcision Location</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Eastleigh Health Centre</strong><br>Eastleigh<br>SO50 9AG</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Because the Southampton-area clinical facilities are arranged specifically for the patient's appointment, having the procedure locally costs more than attending our main clinic in Edgware.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If you would prefer the more economical option, you are welcome to attend our main London clinic instead.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Please contact us to discuss a Southampton circumcision appointment, availability and the arrangements for you or your child.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Southampton enquiries: <a href=\"tel:03301334535\">0330 133 4535</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#enquire\">Enquire about Southampton circumcision</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/contact/\">View our London clinic</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-navy\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"patients-from-southampton\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-navy\" id=\"patients-from-southampton\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Circumcision for Patients from Southampton\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"Patients from Southampton and the surrounding area have two options when choosing Beverley Clinic.\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-2\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Have the circumcision near Southampton\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eIf you specifically want the procedure performed locally, we can arrange your circumcision at:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eEastleigh Health Centre\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEastleigh\\u003cbr\\u003eSO50 9AG\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe arrange the clinical facilities specifically for the patient\\u0026#039;s appointment. For this reason, having the procedure in the Southampton area costs more than attending our main clinic in Edgware.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ePlease contact us for availability and further information.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Contact us about Southampton\",\"ctaUrl\":\"#enquire\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn\"},{\"title\":\"Attend our main clinic in Edgware\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eAlternatively, patients can travel to our main Beverley Clinic in Edgware, North-West London.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis is where we provide our regular circumcision service and is the more economical option for patients who are happy to travel to London.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eBeverley Clinic\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e78 Beverley Drive\\u003cbr\\u003eEdgware\\u003cbr\\u003eNorth-West London\\u003cbr\\u003eHA8 5NE\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"View our London clinic\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/contact/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn\",\"cta2Label\":\"Get directions\",\"cta2Url\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1\\u0026query=78%20Beverley%20Drive%2C%20Edgware%20HA8%205NE\",\"cta2Class\":\"btn btn-ghost\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"all-ages\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"all-ages\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Circumcision in Southampton for All Ages\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"We provide circumcision for babies, toddlers, children, teenagers and adults.\"} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The method used is selected according to the patient's age, anatomy, foreskin development, reason for circumcision and individual circumstances.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-3\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Baby Circumcision in Southampton\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe regularly perform circumcision for newborn babies and infants.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFor babies and younger children where clinically suitable, we may use a Plastibell or Circumplast ring technique.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eParents receive preparation information before the appointment together with detailed guidance about caring for their baby following circumcision.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Baby circumcision \u2192\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/babies/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"},{\"title\":\"Child \\u0026 Teenage Circumcision in Southampton\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe provide circumcision for younger children, older children and teenagers for religious, cultural, personal and medical reasons.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe circumcision technique depends on the child\\u0026#039;s age, anatomy and individual circumstances.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Child \\u0026 teenage circumcision \u2192\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/children/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"},{\"title\":\"Adult Circumcision in Southampton\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eAdults can contact us about circumcision for personal, religious, cultural or medical reasons.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFor older patients, we commonly use a forceps-guided circumcision technique with thermal cautery.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWound closure may involve dissolvable stitches, medical skin glue, a combination of the two or occasionally neither, depending on the individual procedure.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Adult circumcision \u2192\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/adults/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-navy\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"medical-circumcision\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-navy\" id=\"medical-circumcision\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Medical Circumcision in Southampton\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"We also see patients from Southampton and Hampshire who require circumcision because of a medical or foreskin problem.\"} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>This includes patients with:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-2\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Phimosis\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA tight or scarred foreskin that cannot be comfortably retracted.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Read about phimosis \u2192\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/conditions/phimosis/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"},{\"title\":\"Recurrent Balanitis\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eRepeated episodes of inflammation affecting the foreskin and glans.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Read about balanitis \u2192\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/conditions/balanitis/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"},{\"title\":\"BXO / Lichen Sclerosis\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA condition that can cause whitening, tightening and progressive scarring of the foreskin.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Read about BXO / lichen sclerosis \u2192\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/conditions/bxo/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"},{\"title\":\"Other foreskin problems\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eIf you have a foreskin problem and are unsure whether circumcision is appropriate, contact us and explain the problem so that we can advise you about the appropriate appointment.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"32px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\" style=\"margin-top:32px\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>For the foreskin conditions we treat surgically at Beverley Clinic, circumcision is the treatment we provide.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"religious-and-cultural\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"religious-and-cultural\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Religious \\u0026 Cultural Circumcision in Southampton\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"We welcome families and adult patients from Southampton and the surrounding area seeking circumcision for religious or cultural reasons.\"} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our focus is on providing circumcision in an appropriate clinical environment, with clear information before the procedure and detailed aftercare afterwards.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/religious/\">Religious &amp; cultural circumcision \u2192</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-navy\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"why-patients-choose-us\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-navy\" id=\"why-patients-choose-us\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Why Patients Choose Beverley Clinic\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-3\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Circumcision is a core part of our clinical work\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eCircumcision is part of our day-to-day clinical work, rather than an occasional procedure.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOur practitioners have extensive experience in circumcision and have also trained doctors from the UK and abroad in circumcision techniques and patient care.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Babies, children, teenagers and adults\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe provide circumcision across a wide range of ages, from babies through to adults.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis experience is important because circumcising a young baby is different from circumcising an older child, teenager or adult.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Individual approach\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe do not use the same circumcision method for every patient.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe appropriate technique is selected according to factors including age, anatomy, foreskin development, reason for circumcision and findings on examination.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Preparation and aftercare\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eGood circumcision care includes what happens before and after the procedure, not simply the procedure itself.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ePatients and parents receive preparation information before treatment and detailed written aftercare afterwards.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Follow-up care\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eOur care does not simply finish when the patient leaves.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe provide support during the healing period and can arrange an in-person review where required.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAny in-person follow-up appointments following a Southampton-area procedure take place at our main Beverley Clinic in Edgware.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Trusted by patients and parents\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eThousands of patients and parents have shared feedback about their experience of Beverley Clinic through Google, Trustpilot, Yell and feedback sent directly to the clinic.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eMany new patients also come to us following recommendations from previous patients, family members and friends.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Read patient reviews \u2192\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/testimonials/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"our-approach\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"our-approach\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Our Approach to Circumcision\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"The circumcision method used depends on the individual patient.\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-2\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Plastibell \\u0026 Circumplast Circumcision\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eFor babies and younger children where clinically suitable, we may use a Plastibell or Circumplast ring method.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe ring is positioned over the glans beneath the foreskin and the foreskin is secured around it. The ring remains in place following the procedure and normally separates naturally during healing.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eParents receive detailed aftercare instructions explaining how to care for the circumcision at home.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Forceps-Guided Circumcision\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eFor older children, teenagers and adults, we commonly use a forceps-guided circumcision technique with thermal cautery.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe wound may be managed using dissolvable stitches, medical skin glue, a combination of the two or occasionally neither depending on the individual procedure.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /--><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/\">Learn more about circumcision \u2192</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-warm\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"follow-up\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-warm\" id=\"follow-up\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Follow-Up After Circumcision in Southampton\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If you choose to have the procedure in the Southampton area, your circumcision will take place at:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Eastleigh Health Centre</strong><br>Eastleigh<br>SO50 9AG</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>However, Beverley Clinic in Edgware is our main clinical base and follow-up clinic.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If an in-person review or follow-up appointment is required after your circumcision, you will need to attend:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Beverley Clinic</strong><br>78 Beverley Drive<br>Edgware<br>North-West London<br>HA8 5NE</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Patients and parents should take this into consideration when deciding whether to arrange the procedure near Southampton or attend our Edgware clinic from the beginning.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>You will still receive the appropriate preparation information, aftercare guidance and support following your procedure.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/aftercare/\">Aftercare information \u2192</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"southampton-or-edgware\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"southampton-or-edgware\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Southampton or Edgware \u2013 Which Should I Choose?\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-2\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Choose Southampton if:\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYou specifically want the circumcision to take place locally in the Southampton area and are happy for us to arrange clinical premises for your appointment.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAs the facilities have to be arranged specifically for the appointment, the Southampton option has a higher cost.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Choose Edgware if:\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYou are happy to travel to our main circumcision clinic in North-West London and would prefer the more economical option.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eEdgware is our main clinic, where we regularly provide circumcision and where any required in-person follow-up takes place.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"32px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\" style=\"margin-top:32px\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If you are unsure which option is best for you, contact us and we can explain the arrangements.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#enquire\">Ask about Southampton</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/contact/\">View Edgware clinic</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/faq {\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions About Circumcision in Southampton\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Can I have a circumcision in Southampton?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. If you specifically want your or your child's circumcision performed in the Southampton area, we can arrange the procedure at Eastleigh Health Centre, Eastleigh, SO50 9AG.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Where is your Southampton circumcision location?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eCircumcision appointments for patients requesting treatment in the Southampton area can be arranged at:\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003eEastleigh Health Centre, Eastleigh, SO50 9AG.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Is Southampton your main circumcision clinic?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eNo. Our main clinic is Beverley Clinic in Edgware, North-West London.\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003eFor patients who specifically want circumcision near Southampton, we can arrange suitable clinical premises in Eastleigh for the procedure.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Why does circumcision in Southampton cost more?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eOur main clinical facilities are based in Edgware.\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003eFor a Southampton-area appointment, we arrange clinical premises specifically for the patient's procedure. This means the cost is higher than attending our regular Edgware clinic.\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003ePlease contact us for further information.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Can I travel to your London clinic instead?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes.\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003ePatients from Southampton and Hampshire are welcome to attend our main clinic at 78 Beverley Drive, Edgware, HA8 5NE.\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003eThis is the more economical option if you are happy to travel to London.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Where will my follow-up appointment take place?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eAny required in-person follow-up appointment following a circumcision performed near Southampton will take place at our main Beverley Clinic in Edgware.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Do you provide baby circumcision in Southampton?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. We provide circumcision for newborn babies and infants. The appropriate method depends on the baby's age, anatomy and clinical suitability.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Do you provide circumcision for older children and teenagers?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. We provide circumcision for younger children, older children and teenagers.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Do you provide adult circumcision in Southampton?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. Adults can contact us about circumcision for personal, religious, cultural or medical reasons.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Do you provide circumcision for phimosis and other foreskin problems?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. We provide circumcision for medical and foreskin problems including phimosis, recurrent balanitis and BXO / lichen sclerosis.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"enquire\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"enquire\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Enquire About Circumcision in Southampton\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"If you live in Southampton, Eastleigh or the surrounding area, you can choose between having the procedure arranged locally or travelling to our main Beverley Clinic in Edgware.\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-2\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Southampton Area\",\"html\":\"<p><strong>Eastleigh Health Centre</strong><br>Eastleigh<br>SO50 9AG</p><p>Clinical facilities are arranged specifically for your appointment, so this option has a higher cost.</p><p>Southampton enquiries: <a href=\\\"tel:03301334535\\\">0330 133 4535</a></p>\"},{\"title\":\"Main Beverley Clinic \u2013 Edgware\",\"html\":\"<p><strong>Beverley Clinic</strong><br>78 Beverley Drive<br>Edgware<br>North-West London<br>HA8 5NE</p><p>Our Edgware clinic is the more economical option and is also where any required in-person follow-up appointments take place.</p>\"}]} /--><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>When contacting us, please tell us:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"cil-checklist\"} --><ul class=\"cil-checklist wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>The patient's age</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>The reason for circumcision</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Whether you prefer Southampton/Eastleigh or Edgware</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Whether there is a medical or foreskin problem</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#southampton\">Enquire about Southampton circumcision</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/contact/\">View Edgware clinic</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/testimonials/\">Read patient reviews</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band {\"title\":\"If you have further questions\",\"text\":\"<p>If you have further questions, you can either <a href=\\\"tel:03301334535\\\">call us</a> or <a href=\\\"#request-callback\\\">request for us to call you back</a>. You can also send us an email enquiry or speak to us via Whatsapp.</p><p class=\\\"cil-cta-contacts\\\"><a class=\\\"cil-cta-contact cil-cta-contact--email\\\" href=\\\"mailto:info@circumcisioninlondon.co.uk\\\"><span class=\\\"cil-cta-contact__label\\\">Email</span>info@circumcisioninlondon.co.uk</a><a class=\\\"cil-cta-contact cil-cta-contact--whatsapp\\\" href=\\\"https://w